circle-gadget-wake.patch - the DWC2 gadget's bus resume, on top of circle-gadget.patch (Pi 4 and Pi 5; pi/engine/build.sh).
Its own file and marker, as circle-hid-reenum2.patch: circle-gadget.patch is already applied in every existing tree, so an
edit to it would not reach them. Needs include/circle/usb/gadget/gadgetwake.h, pi/circle/gadget_wake.h copied in.
  - the wake-up interrupt on; it, or endpoint activity during a suspend, returns to the state before the suspend and calls
    the new CDWUSBGadgetEndpoint::OnResume (). Before, a resume without a reset left EP0 dropping SETUPs until a reset
  - a suspend interrupt that runs after the bus resumed (DSTS.SuspSts clear) is ignored
GPL-3.0-or-later as Circle.
